# Testing

Use Vitest for deterministic tests. Keep real-backend checks opt-in so CI does not depend on DMRC.

Cover same-station input, a direct journey, one interchange, unknown station codes, HTML error bodies, missing fare, and English station names from the snapshot.

A fixture test that passes is not a live integration. Record the command and result before calling a flow verified.

Manual notes still required before release claims: keyboard-only planning, 200% text, narrow and desktop layouts, contrast, and one screen-reader pass. Write down what was not run.
